The FCIE register descriptions and transaction sequences referenced by
Bootstrap.lean derive from TCLOpenSource/mt9221, commit
098aa173622fa59a5531b9b01d8f9fc3b0e539f8:
  drivers/mstar2/drv/mmc/inc/config/eMMC_reg_v5.h
  drivers/mstar2/drv/mmc/src/common/eMMC_hal_v5.c
Those files offer GPL-2.0-only OR BSD-3-Clause; the BSD option is used here.

